        {
          "line": 2,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": "The **execution plane** of FlexNetOS's GitHub\u2194local automation: a local, self-hosted runner that"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "text": "executes CI/jobs/loops on the developer's own hardware and **connects all of meta** by routing work"
        },
        {
          "line": 10,
          "text": "Two shapes, by design:"
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "1. **Self-hosted GitHub Actions runner** \u2014 JIT/ephemeral (`generate-jitconfig`, single-job-then-"
        },
        {
          "line": 12,
          "text": "   removed), with safety rails (non-root, no Docker socket, `_work` on tmpfs, **fork-PR isolation**)."
        },
        {
          "line": 73,
          "text": "| `runner-core` | \u2014 | Pure core: signed job-spec type, kernel router (delegate-only), fork-PR isolation policy, JIT lifecycle state. Fully unit-tested. |"
        },
        {
          "line": 74,
          "text": "| `runner-actions` | `fxrun-actions` | Self-hosted Actions runner supervisor (JIT register \u2192 run one \u2192 deregister). P1. |"
        },
        {
          "line": 75,
          "text": "| `runner-dispatch` | `fxrun-dispatch` | UDS server: verify signed job spec \u2192 route \u2192 invoke kernel. P2. |"
        },
        {
          "line": 126,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 127,
          "text": "Canonical operation is one org-scoped FlexNetOS runner, shared by meta peer repositories through the"
        },
        {
          "line": 128,
          "text": "labels `self-hosted,linux,x64,local,flexnetos`. A local `.runner` that points at"
        },
        {
          "line": 129,
